# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Blood
log Blood - 900306 Bloodworm Burst: a bloodworm (28017) explodes when it dies (900307, 10 yd round the worm) and when its 20 s run out
do dk learn 900306
spelllog start
do dk cast 50452 on d1 triggered
wait 1s
expect dk minions 28017 >= 1
pick w1 creature:28017 near dk
require w1 exists
do gm target w1
as gm .die
do gm target dk
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect dk spell 900307 targets >= 6
spelllog start
do dk cast 50452 on d1 triggered
waitfor dk spell 900307 casts >= 1 timeout 25s
wait 500ms
spelllog stop
expect dk spell 900307 targets >= 6

cleanup
do dk stop
do dk destroy 37201
do dk destroy 38632
do gm target dk
as gm .unaura 32182
as gm .unaura 49039
as gm .unaura 900374
as gm .unlearn 900306
as gm .unlearn 900334
as gm .unlearn 900335
as gm .unlearn 900336
as gm .unlearn 900337
as gm .unlearn 900338
as gm .unlearn 900340
